<title>UK: EIB sets 250 mln stg Dec 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 250 mln stg Dec 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     ***	 MATURITY    07.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  ***	 PAY DATE   S24.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    ***	 SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	***TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		S - SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1/10/100  SALE LIMITS UK ONLY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   *IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  1.45</p>
<p> NOTES	*SUBJECT TO PRIOR CONSULTATION</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
